<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on Hong Kong banks basket.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on Hong Kong banks basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Wednesday it has issued 430 million American-style call warrants on shares of a basket of three Hong Kong banks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> HSBC Holdings Plc			0.1</p>
<p>shares</p>
<p> Hang Seng Bank Ltd		     0.1 shares</p>
<p> Bank of East Asia Ltd		  0.1 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$34.3805    PREMIUM	 19.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.2938     GEARING	 10.6X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 14.NOV.97     PAYDATE	 2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG     MIN EXER LOT  40,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$31.255</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW    HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
